; Second independent AI board review after the first review has been embodied.
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk observe/review-panel.fk observe/review-ask.fk

(ra-review
  "plugin/public-dialogue.fk"
  "Second adversarial verification only; do not edit any file. Re-read the current Form-native dialogue implementation, contracts, receipt, and all public-dialogue proof cells after first-board findings were addressed. Freshly preflight and execute the direct, restart, socket, contract, and existing-plugin regression witnesses. Seek counterexamples the first review could miss: traversal from every anchor, sibling and chain ordering, partial deletion, guessed or cross-turn capabilities, stale content recovery, malformed MCP JSON-RPC, partial HTTP bodies, Unicode locale content, filesystem restart behavior, and any path that invokes Python or non-Form application code. Return PASS AS A FORM-NATIVE PERSISTENT DIALOGUE, REVISE, or BLOCK with executable evidence. Empty or unfinished output is absence, not a vote.")
